---
import PresentationLayout from "@components/PresentationLayout.astro";
import venn from "./assets/svg/consensus-traits-venn.svg";
---

<PresentationLayout eyebrow="共识类资产" title="三大特性" narrow>
  <div class="root">
    {/* Left: what the asset class is (definition + the two ways consensus plays out) and the verdict. */}
    <div class="leftCol">
      <div class="defCard">
        <div class="defHead">
          <div class="defRule"></div>
          <div class="defLead">
            本身<strong>不产生现金流</strong>，<br />价值完全取决于市场共识。
          </div>
          <div class="defFormula">value = f(consensus)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="defFlows">
          <div class="flowRow">
            <span class="flowTag">共识扩大</span>
            <span class="flowArrow">→</span>
            <span class="flowText">有后继者接盘</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flowRow">
            <span class="flowTag">共识破裂</span>
            <span class="flowArrow">→</span>
            <span class="flowText">无法脱手</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="conclusion">
        <div class="conclusionText">
          <strong>💡 核心结论：</strong>这三大属性也只是让这些东西<strong>比一般消费品更保值</strong>而已——拉长时间线看，共识总会转移，无一例外都无法脱手。
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Right: the three traits themselves. */}
    <div class="rightCol">
      <img
        src={venn.src}
        class="venn"
        alt="实用价值、稀缺性、可长期保存三个条件的韦恩图：每个单项与两两组合各自对应一类东西，只有三者同时满足才形成共识类资产"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</PresentationLayout>

<style>
  .root {
    height: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.24fr;
    gap: 1.6rem;
  }

  /* ---- left column ---- */
  .leftCol {
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  /* Definition card, reworked from the deck's beige card into a panel that owns the column: heading on top, the two outcomes pinned to the bottom, slack shared between them. */
  .defCard {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: #f0e6cd;
    border: 1px solid #d9c49a;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem 1.4rem;
  }

  /* Statement first, the formalisation it implies second, the two outcomes last. */
  .defRule {
    width: 3.2rem;
    height: 3px;
    background: #c9a86a;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .defLead {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #5c4a20;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .defLead strong {
    color: #6b4226;
  }

  .defFormula {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-family: "Times New Roman", "Nimbus Roman", "Songti SC", "SimSun", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #6b4226;
    text-align: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* The two ways consensus can move, as chips instead of the original inline sentence. */
  .defFlows {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .flowRow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
    border-left: 3px solid #b99a5e;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .flowTag {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #6b4226;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .flowArrow {
    color: #a08a6a;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .flowText {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #5c4a20;
  }

  /* Verdict: white card with the brown rule, so it reads apart from the beige panel above. */
  .conclusion {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e2d6bb;
    border-left: 4px solid #6b4226;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
  }

  .conclusionText {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #5c3a21;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .conclusionText strong {
    color: #6b4226;
  }

  /* ---- right column ---- */
  .rightCol {
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Height-bound so the diagram fills the column; the explicit aspect-ratio keeps the width derivation off the SVG's (absent) intrinsic size. */
  .venn {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 700 / 620;
  }
</style>
